#: rc.cpp:1 rc.cpp:19 rc.cpp:58
msgid "Form1"
msgstr "Vorm1"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "<b>Advanced Options</b>"
msgstr "<b>Gevorderde Opsies</b>"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "&Hide button size:"
msgstr "Steek weg knoppie grootte:"

#: rc.cpp:4 rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"This setting defines how large the panel hide buttons will be if they are "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opset definieer hoe groot die paneel steek weg knoppies sal wees as "
"hulle word sigbare."

#: rc.cpp:5 rc.cpp:161
msgid " pixels"
msgstr " beeld elemente"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "&Fade out applet handles"
msgstr "Uitdoof uit miniprogram handvatsels"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid ""
"All applets that appear on the KDE panel have a small handle associated with "
"them. By selecting this option these handles will be faded out and not shown "
"by default."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:9 rc.cpp:96 rc.cpp:125
msgid "Form2"
msgstr "Form2"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Security Level"
msgstr "Sekuriteit Vlak"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "Load only trusted applets internal"
msgstr "Las slegs vertroude miniprogramme intern"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Load startup config applets internal"
msgstr "Las opstart opstelling miniprogramme intern"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "Load all applets internal"
msgstr "Las alle miniprogramme intern"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "List of Trusted Applets"
msgstr "Lys van Vertroude Miniprogramme"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Available Applets"
msgstr "Beskikbaar Miniprogramme"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid ">>"
msgstr ">>"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "<<"
msgstr "<<"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "Trusted Applets"
msgstr "Vertroude Miniprogramme"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "Hide Mode"
msgstr "Steek weg Modus"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Allow other &windows to cover the panel"
msgstr "Toelaat ander vensters na omhulsel die paneel"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, the panel will allow itself to be covered by "
"other windows."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is gekose, die paneel sal toelaat self na wees bedek deur "
"ander vensters."

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid "after the &cursor leaves the panel"
msgstr "na die plekaanduier los die paneel"

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "&Only hide when a panel-hiding button is clicked"
msgstr "Slegs steek weg wanneer 'n panel-hiding knoppie is gekliek het"

#: rc.cpp:25
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, the only way to hide the panel will be to click "
"on the hide buttons that appear on either end of it."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is gekose, die slegs weg na steek weg die paneel sal wees "
"na kliek op die steek weg knoppies wat verskyn op òf einde van dit."

#: rc.cpp:26
msgid "&Raise when the pointer touches the screen's:"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:27
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, moving the pointer to the specified edge of "
"the screen will cause the panel to appear on top of any windows that may be "
"covering it."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:28
msgid "Top Left Corner"
msgstr "Bo Links Hoek"

#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "Top Edge"
msgstr "Bo Rand"

#: rc.cpp:30
msgid "Top Right Corner"
msgstr "Bo Regterkant Hoek"

#: rc.cpp:31
msgid "Right Edge"
msgstr "Regterkant Rand"

#: rc.cpp:32
msgid "Bottom Right Corner"
msgstr "Bodem Regterkant Hoek"

#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "Bottom Edge"
msgstr "Bodem Rand"

#: rc.cpp:34
msgid "Bottom Left Corner"
msgstr "Bodem Links Hoek"

#: rc.cpp:35
msgid "Left Edge"
msgstr "Links Rand"

#: rc.cpp:36
msgid ""
"Here you can set the location on the screen's edge that will bring the panel "
"to the front."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan stel die ligging op die screen's rand wat sal bring die paneel "
"na die voor."

#: rc.cpp:37
msgid "&Show panel when switching desktops"
msgstr "Vertoon paneel wanneer omskakeling werkskerms"

#: rc.cpp:38
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the panel will automatically show itself for a "
"brief period of time when the desktop is switched so you can see which "
"desktop you are on."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, die paneel sal automaties vertoon self vir "
"'n kort periode van tyd wanneer die werkskerm is geskakel sodat jy kan sien "
"wat werkskerm jy word op."

#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "Hide a&utomatically"
msgstr "Steek weg automaties"

#: rc.cpp:40
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, the panel will automatically hide after a period "
"of time and reappear when you move the mouse to the screen edge where the "
"panel is hidden. This is particularly useful for small screen resolutions, "
"such as on laptops."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie opsie is gekose, die paneel sal automaties steek weg na 'n "
"periode van tyd en herverskyn wanneer jy beweeg die muis na die skerm rand "
"waar die paneel is weg gesteekte. hierdie is in besonder bruikbare vir klein "
"skerm resolusie, soos as op skootrekenaars."

#: rc.cpp:41
msgid " sec"
msgstr " sek"

#: rc.cpp:42
msgid "Immediately"
msgstr "Dadelik"

#: rc.cpp:43
msgid ""
"Here you can change the delay after which the panel will disappear if not "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan verander die vertraging na wat die paneel sal verdwyn as nie "
"gebruik word."

#: rc.cpp:44
msgid "Panel-Hiding Buttons"
msgstr "Panel-Hiding Knoppies"

#: rc.cpp:45
msgid ""
"This option controls the panel-hiding buttons, which are buttons with a "
"small triangle found at the ends of the panel. You can place a button at "
"either end of the panel, or both. Clicking on one of these buttons will hide "
"the panel."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie kontroles die paneel-hiding knoppies, wat word knoppies met 'n "
"klein driehoek gevind na die einde van die paneel. Jy kan plek 'n knoppie na "
"òf einde van die paneel, van beide. Te kliek op een van hierdie knoppies "
"sal steek weg die paneel."

#: rc.cpp:46
msgid "Show left panel-hiding bu&tton"
msgstr "Vertoon links panel-hiding knoppie"

#: rc.cpp:47
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, a panel-hiding button appears on the left end "
"of the panel."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose, 'n paneel-hiding knoppie verskyn op die "
"links einde van die paneel."

#: rc.cpp:48
msgid "Show right panel-hiding &button"
msgstr "Vertoon regterkant panel-hiding knoppie"

#: rc.cpp:49
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, a panel-hiding button appears on the right end "
"of the panel."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose, 'n paneel-hiding knoppie verskyn op die "
"regterkant einde van die paneel."

#: rc.cpp:50
msgid "Panel Animation"
msgstr "Paneel Animasie"

#: rc.cpp:51
msgid "A&nimate panel hiding"
msgstr "Animeer paneel versteek"

#: rc.cpp:52
msgid ""
"When this option is selected the panel will \"slide\" off the screen when "
"hiding. The speed of the animation is controlled by the slider directly "
"below."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:53
msgid "Determines how quickly the panel hides if hiding animation is enabled."
msgstr "Bepaal hoe vinnig die paneel steek weg as versteek animasie is geaktiveer."

#: rc.cpp:54
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Vinnige"

#: rc.cpp:55
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Medium"

#: rc.cpp:56
msgid "Slow"
msgstr "Stadige"

#: rc.cpp:57 rc.cpp:127
msgid "Panels"
msgstr "Panele"

#: rc.cpp:59
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, informational tooltips will appear when the "
"mouse cursor moves over the icons, buttons and applets in the panel."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is gekose, inligting sleutel-leidraad sal verskyn wanneer "
"die muis plekaanduier skuiwe bo die ikoone, knoppies en miniprogramme in die "
"paneel."

#: rc.cpp:60
msgid "General"
msgstr "Algemeen"

#: rc.cpp:61
msgid "Enable icon &zooming"
msgstr "Aktiveer ikoon vergroting"

#: rc.cpp:62
msgid ""
"When this option is selected the button icons are zoomed when the mouse "
"cursor is moved over them."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose die knoppie ikoone word gezoem Wanneer die "
"muis plekaanduier is verskuif bo hulle."

#: rc.cpp:63
msgid "Sh&ow tooltips"
msgstr "Vertoon sleutel-leidraad"

#: rc.cpp:64
msgid ""
"When this option is selected informational tooltips will appear when the "
"mouse cursor moves over the icons, buttons and applets in the panel."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose inligting sleutel-leidraad sal verskyn "
"Wanneer die muis plekaanduier skuiwe bo die ikoone, knoppies en "
"miniprogramme in die paneel."

#: rc.cpp:65
msgid "Button Background"
msgstr "Knoppie Agtergrond"

#: rc.cpp:66
msgid "De&sktop access:"
msgstr "Werkskerm toegang verkry:"

#: rc.cpp:67 rc.cpp:87
msgid "Choose a tile image for desktop access buttons."
msgstr "Kies 'n teël beeld vir werkskerm toegang verkry knoppies."

#: rc.cpp:68
msgid "&K menu:"
msgstr "K kieslys:"

#: rc.cpp:69 rc.cpp:89
msgid "Choose a tile image for the K menu."
msgstr "Kies 'n teël beeld vir die K kieslys."

#: rc.cpp:70
msgid "&Legacy applications:"
msgstr "Oorgeërfde programme:"

#: rc.cpp:71 rc.cpp:79
msgid "Choose a tile image for legacy application buttons."
msgstr "Kies 'n teël beeld vir oorgeërfde aansoek knoppies."

#: rc.cpp:72
msgid "&QuickBrowser menus:"
msgstr "Vinnige blaaier kieslyste:"

#: rc.cpp:73 rc.cpp:81
msgid "Choose a tile image for Quick Browser buttons."
msgstr "Kies 'n teël beeld vir Vinnige Blaaier knoppies."

#: rc.cpp:74
msgid "&Window list:"
msgstr "Venster lys:"

#: rc.cpp:75 rc.cpp:85
msgid "Choose a tile image for window list buttons."
msgstr "Kies 'n teël beeld vir venster lys knoppies."

#: rc.cpp:76
msgid "Applicatio&ns:"
msgstr "Programme:"

#: rc.cpp:77 rc.cpp:83
msgid "Choose a tile image for buttons that launch applications."
msgstr "Kies 'n teël beeld vir knoppies wat lanseer programme."

#: rc.cpp:90
msgid "Panel Background"
msgstr "Paneel Agtergrond"

#: rc.cpp:91
msgid "This is a preview for the selected background image."
msgstr "Hierdie is 'n voorskou vir die gekose agtergrond beeld."

#: rc.cpp:92
msgid "Enable &background image"
msgstr "Aktiveer agtergrond beeld"

#: rc.cpp:93
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, you can choose a background image that will be "
"displayed on the panel. If it is not selected, the default colors will be "
"used, see the 'Colors' control module."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is gekose, jy kan kies 'n agtergrond beeld wat sal wees "
"vertoon op die paneel. As dit is nie gekose, die verstek kleure sal wees "
"gebruik word, sien die 'kleure' kontrole module."

#: rc.cpp:94
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a theme to be displayed by the panel. Press the 'Browse' "
"button to choose a theme using the file dialog."
"<p> This option is only active if 'Enable background image' is selected."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan kies 'n tema na wees vertoon deur die paneel. Druk die 'Browse' "
"knoppie na kies 'n tema te gebruik die lêer dialoog."
"<p> Hierdie opsie is slegs aktief as 'Enable agtergrond image' is gekose."

#: rc.cpp:95
msgid "Advan&ced Options..."
msgstr "Gevorderde Opsies..."

#: rc.cpp:97
msgid "K Menu"
msgstr "K Kieslys"

#: rc.cpp:98
msgid "Optional Sub Menus"
msgstr "Opsionele Sub Kieslyste"

#: rc.cpp:99
msgid ""
"This is a list of the dynamic menus that can be displayed in the KDE menu in "
"addition to the normal applications. Use the checkboxes to add or remove "
"menus."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is 'n lys van die dinamiese kieslyste wat kan wees vertoon in die "
"Kde kieslys in byvoeging na die normale programme. Gebruik die merkboksies "
"na voeg by of verwyder kieslyste."

#: rc.cpp:100
msgid "Menu item format:"
msgstr "Kieslys item formaat:"

#: rc.cpp:101
msgid "This is a preview of the tile that will be used for window list buttons."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is 'n voorskou van die teël wat sal wees gebruik word vir venster "
"lys knoppies."

#: rc.cpp:102
msgid "&Name only"
msgstr "Naam slegs"

#: rc.cpp:103
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, items in the K Menu will appear with the "
"application's name next to the icon."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose, iteme in die K Kieslys sal verskyn met die "
"application's naam volgende na die ikoon."

#: rc.cpp:104
msgid "Na&me (Description)"
msgstr "Naam (Beskrywing)"

#: rc.cpp:105
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, items in the K Menu will appear with the "
"application's name and a brief description in brackets next to the icon."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose, iteme in die K Kieslys sal verskyn met die "
"application's naam en 'n kort beskrywing in hakkies volgende na die ikoon."

#: rc.cpp:106
msgid "Des&cription (Name)"
msgstr "Beskrywing (Naam)"

#: rc.cpp:107
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, items in the K Menu will appear with a brief "
"description and the application's name in brackets next to the icon."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose, iteme in die K Kieslys sal verskyn met 'n "
"kort beskrywing en die application's naam in hakkies volgende na die ikoon."

#: rc.cpp:108
msgid "Edit &K Menu"
msgstr "Redigeer K Kieslys"

#: rc.cpp:109
msgid "Show &side image"
msgstr "Vertoon kant beeld"

#: rc.cpp:110
msgid ""
"<qt>When this option is selected an image will appear down the left-hand "
"side of the K Menu. The image will be tinted according to your color "
"settings.\n"
"\n"
"<p><b>Tip</b>: You can customize the image that appears in the K Menu by "
"putting an image file called kside.png and a tileable image file called "
"kside_tile.png in $KDEHOME/share/apps/kicker/pics.</qt>"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:111
msgid "QuickBrowser Menus"
msgstr "Vinnige blaaier Kieslyste"

#: rc.cpp:112
msgid "Ma&ximum number of entries:"
msgstr "Maksimum nommer van inskrywings:"

#: rc.cpp:113 rc.cpp:114
msgid ""
"When browsing directories that contain a lot of files, the QuickBrowser can "
"sometimes hide your whole desktop. Here you can limit the number of entries "
"shown at a time in the QuickBrowser. This is particularly useful for low "
"screen resolutions."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer blaaiïng gidse wat bevat 'n baie van lêers, die Vinnige blaaier "
"kan party keer steek weg jou volledige werkskerm. Hier jy kan beperk die "
"nommer van inskrywings vertoon na 'n tyd in die Vinnige blaaier. Hierdie is "
"in besonder bruikbare vir lae skerm resolusie."

#: rc.cpp:115
msgid "Sh&ow hidden files"
msgstr "Vertoon weg gesteekte lêers"

#: rc.cpp:116
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, hidden files (i.e. files beginning with a dot) "
"will be shown in the QuickBrowser menus."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, weg gesteekte lêers (i.e. lêers begin met "
"'n punt) sal wees vertoon in die Vinnige blaaier kieslyste."

#: rc.cpp:117
msgid "QuickStart Menu Items"
msgstr "Woerts-warts Kieslys Iteme"

#: rc.cpp:118
msgid "Maxim&um number of entries:"
msgstr "Maksimum nommer van inskrywings:"

#: rc.cpp:119
msgid ""
"This option allows you to define the maximum number of applications that "
"should be displayed in the QuickStart menu area."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie laat toe jy na definieer die maksimum nommer van programme wat "
"moet wees vertoon in die Woerts-warts kieslys area."

#: rc.cpp:120
msgid ""
"This option allows you to define how many applications should be displayed "
"at most in the QuickStart menu area."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie laat toe jy na definieer hoe veel programme moet wees vertoon "
"na mees in die Woerts-warts kieslys area."

#: rc.cpp:121
msgid "Sho&w the applications most recently used"
msgstr "Vertoon die programme mees onlangse gebruik word"

#: rc.cpp:122
msgid ""
"When this option is selected the QuickStart menu area will be filled with "
"the applications you have used most recently."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose die Woerts-warts kieslys area sal wees gevul "
"met die programme jy het gebruik word mees onlangse."

#: rc.cpp:123
msgid "Show &the applications most frequently used"
msgstr "Vertoon die programme mees dikwels gebruik word"

#: rc.cpp:124
msgid ""
"When this option is selected the QuickStart menu area will be filled with "
"the applications you use most frequently."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose die Woerts-warts kieslys area sal wees gevul "
"met die programme jy gebruik mees dikwels."

#: rc.cpp:126
msgid ""
"This is a list of all the panels currently active on your desktop. Select "
"one to configure."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is 'n lys van alle die panele huidiglik aktief op jou werkskerm. "
"Kies een na konfigureer."

#: rc.cpp:128
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Posisie"

#: rc.cpp:141
msgid "Len&gth"
msgstr "Lengte"

#: rc.cpp:142
msgid ""
"This group of settings determines how the panel is aligned, including\n"
"how it is positioned on the screen and how much of the screen it should use."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie groep van instellings bepaal hoe die paneel is opgelyn, insluitend\n"
"hoe dit is geposisioneer op die skerm en hoe baie van die skerm dit moet "
"gebruik."

#: rc.cpp:143
msgid ""
"This slider defines how much of the screen's edge will be occupied by the "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie skuiwer definieer hoe baie van die screen's rand sal wees besige "
"deur die paneel."

#: rc.cpp:144
#, c-format
msgid "%"
msgstr "%"

#: rc.cpp:145
msgid ""
"This spinbox defines how much of the screen's edge will be occupied by the "
"panel."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:146
msgid "E&xpand as required to fit contents"
msgstr "Vergroot as benodig na pas inhoud"

#: rc.cpp:147
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, the panel will grow as necessary to "
"accommodate the buttons and applets on it."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:148
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Grootte"

#: rc.cpp:149
msgid ""
"This sets the size of the panel. You can also access this option via the "
"panel context menu by right-clicking on some free space on the panel."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie verstel die grootte van die paneel. Jy kan asook toegang verkry "
"Hierdie opsie deur middel van die paneel konteks kieslys deur right-clicking "
"op sommige vry spasie op die paneel."

#: rc.cpp:150
msgid "&Tiny"
msgstr "Baie klein"

#: rc.cpp:151
msgid "When this option is selected the panel will be 24 pixels high."
msgstr "Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose die paneel sal wees 24 beeld elemente hoog."

#: rc.cpp:152
msgid "La&rge"
msgstr "Groot"

#: rc.cpp:153
msgid "When this option is selected the panel will be 58 pixels high."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:154
msgid "&Normal"
msgstr "Normale"

#: rc.cpp:155
msgid "When this option is selected the panel will be 46 pixels high."
msgstr "Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose die paneel sal wees 46 beeld elemente hoog."

#: rc.cpp:156
msgid "&Small"
msgstr "Klein"

#: rc.cpp:157
msgid "When this option is selected the panel will be 30 pixels high."
msgstr "Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose die paneel sal wees 30 beeld elemente hoog."

#: rc.cpp:158
msgid "C&ustom"
msgstr "Pasmaak"

#: rc.cpp:159
msgid ""
"When this option is selected the panel can be adjusted to any size between "
"24 and 128 pixels using the slider below."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose die paneel kan wees aangepas na enige "
"grootte tussen 24 en 128 beeld elemente te gebruik die skuiwer onder."

#: rc.cpp:160
msgid "This slider defines the panel size when the Custom option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie skuiwer definieer die paneel grootte wanneer die Pasmaak opsie is "
"gekose."

#: rc.cpp:162
msgid "This spinbox defines the panel size when the Custom option is selected."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:163
msgid "Screen"
msgstr "Skerm"

#: rc.cpp:164
msgid ""
"This preview image shows how the panel will appear on your screen with the "
"settings you have chosen. Clicking the buttons around the image will move "
"the positon of the panel, while moving the length slider and choosing "
"different sizes will change the dimensions of the panel."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:165
msgid "Identify"
msgstr "Identifiseer"

#: rc.cpp:166
msgid "This button displays each monitor's identifying number"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:167
msgid "Xinerama Screen"
msgstr "Xinerama Skerm"

#: rc.cpp:168
msgid ""
"This menu selects which screen the Panel will be displayed on in a "
"multiple-monitor system"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie kieslys kies wat skerm die Paneel sal wees vertoon op in 'n "
"multiple-monitor stelsel"

